  "primary": "A projectile flies in an arc where you look and strikes the first target. Effects:\n• Damage 1.25 ❤ fire + 1.25 ❤ earth (fire ×0.5 on wet, earth ×2 on frozen)\n• Heat: sets on fire for 6 s (wet targets just dry off), thaws; melts ice and burns roots\n• Cold 80: extinguishes and slows, freezes for 4 s at 100 built-up cold (×2.5 on wet); puddles freeze\n• If the target is frozen or brittle: damage 7.25 ❤ thermal\n• Light push\n• Breaks up to 3 blocks within 0.5 blocks (twice as many if brittle)",
